                      "databaseId": 4115612229,
                      "author": {
                        "login": "kemrec"
                      },
                      "body": "Done \u2014 `_validate_field_path` re-resolves `excluded_fields` for whichever model the path is currently in via `query_tool_models`, starting from the root model's own set and updating it on every relation hop. If a related model passes the `allowed_models` check but isn't found in `query_tool_models`, it now fails closed with a ValueError rather than silently applying no exclusions.",
